Author: Kaung Si Thu <kgcthu.kev@gmail.com>
Date:   Tue Oct 21 13:32:30 2025 +0630

    feat: Initialize React project and basic SRT cleaning logic
    
    Sets up the project structure for the SRT Subtitle Cleaner & Language Detector.
    This includes:
    - Initializing a Vite-based React project.
    - Adding necessary dependencies (React, ReactDOM, Vite, TypeScript).
    - Configuring TypeScript and Vite.
    - Implementing the initial logic for cleaning SRT content, including:
        - Removing backslashes from timestamps and HTML tags.
        - Removing text within square brackets and parentheses.
        - Removing specific Myanmar characters.
    - Adding placeholder functions and types for language detection and change summaries.
    - Updating README with local run instructions.

